# joy (roadmap os-server.md P12): one reading of /dev/joystick, where no
# joystick is: on Bochs and MAME. (DOSBox-X's centred stick reads 684 to
# 687 us, as its polling falls; tests/posix/devices.test checks it there.)
program: sh
emulators: bochs mame
install: C /BIN/JOY z-joy.rx
keys: joy\n
---
rx286, test build
/a$ joy
buttons: none; axes: absent absent absent absent
/a$
